msgid "English"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:89 includes/Admin/views/admin.php:81
#: includes/Plugin.php:300
msgid ""
"You are an expert SEO content writer. Generate factually accurate, "
"engaging, and well-structured articles optimized for readability and search "
"engines."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:97
msgid "Title is required. Please, start with \"Write an article on...\""
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:103
msgid "Prompt type is required. Please, select the prompt type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:109
msgid "Language is required. Please, select the language."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:115
msgid "Post type is required. Please, select the post type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:123
msgid ""
"Please configure the settings to enable the AI Content Writer plugin "
"features."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:134 includes/Plugin.php:220
msgid ""
"Please configure the API settings. A valid Gemini API key is required to "
"generate the content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:213
msgid ""
"Please configure the API settings. A valid ChatGPT API secret key is "
"required to generate the content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:221
#. translators: 1: Prompt Content, 2: System Tone, 3: Language, 4: Min Words
msgid ""
"%1$s with a professional tone. %2$s Ensure the content is engaging, easy to "
"read, and formatted with proper headings (H2, H3), bullet points, and "
"paragraphs.\n"
"\n"
"Use %3$s as the language for this article. Keep the word count minimum of "
"%4$s words for the best readability and SEO ranking.\n"
"\n"
"The article should include:\n"
"\n"
"- A catchy introduction that hooks the reader\n"
"- Informative body sections with subheadings\n"
"- A compelling conclusion with key takeaways\n"
"\n"
"Avoid fluff, keep sentences concise, and ensure factual accuracy. Where "
"applicable, use industry insights, statistics, and real-world examples. If "
"necessary, cite reliable sources to back up claims. Ensure no AI or robotic "
"tone—the content should feel human-written."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:236
msgid "The article should be optimized for SEO"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:236
msgid "The article should be optimized for SEO, including relevant keywords: "
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:263
msgid "Invalid API model. Please configure the API settings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:298 includes/Admin/Actions.php:303
msgid "Content generated successfully."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:328
msgid "Invalid post. Please try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:334
msgid "Invalid image. Please select an image."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:344
msgid "Invalid image URL. Please try again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Actions.php:358
msgid "Content generated and featured image set successfully."
msgstr ""

