#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:17
msgid ""
"The following information will help you generate API keys to use with the "
"AI Content Writer plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:23
msgid "Here's how you can generate Google Gemini API key:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:24
msgid ""
"Here's a step-by-step guide to obtaining a free API key for Google Gemini "
"and using it in Google AI Studio:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:27
msgid "Visit the Google AI API KEY landing page"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:28
msgid "Google Cloud Platform"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:29
msgid ""
"Under section \"Get a Gemini API key\", click on the \"Get  a Gemini API "
"key in Google AI Studio\" button."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:32
msgid "Create Google Gemini API Key in Google AI Studio:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:33
msgid ""
"If you do previous step correctly, you will be redirected to Google AI "
"Studio where you can create a new project and generate an API key or click "
"on the bellow link to visit Google AI Studio directly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:34
msgid "Google AI Studio/App/API Key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:35
msgid ""
"Simply click on the \"Create API Key\" button to generate a new API key. "
"While creating the API key, you may need to create a new project in Google "
"AI Studio and enable the Gemini API. There are no charges for using the "
"Gemini API if you chose the free module."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:38
msgid "Copy the API Key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:39
msgid ""
"After creating the API key, copy the key and save it in a secure location. "
"You also have the opportunity to get the API key later from that page. The "
"list of API keys will be displayed in the Google AI Studio."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:40
msgid "List of API key's"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:43
msgid "Important Notes:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:45
msgid ""
"Free Usage Limits: Be aware of the free usage limits for the Gemini API. "
"Exceeding these limits may incur charges."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:46
msgid ""
"API Usage: Refer to the Gemini API documentation for specific usage "
"guidelines and best practices."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:47
msgid "Security: Handle your API key securely to prevent unauthorized access."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:49
msgid "Additional Resources:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:53
msgid "Gemini APP"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:58
msgid "Gemini API Documentation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:63
msgid "Generative Google AI Studio"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:67
msgid ""
"By following these steps, you can effectively utilize the Gemini API in "
"your Google AI Studio projects. If you encounter any issues or have "
"questions, refer to the official documentation or contact Google Cloud "
"Platform support."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:69
msgid "Here's how you can get ChatGPT OpenAI API key:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:70
msgid "Here are the steps to create a ChatGPT OpenAI API key:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:73
msgid "Sign Up/Log In: Go to OpenAI.com and create an account or log in."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:74
msgid "OpenAI Website"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:77
msgid "Access API Page: Navigate to the OpenAI API page form the profile dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:78
msgid "Profile => OpenAI API Keys Page"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:81
msgid ""
"Generate API Key: Click \"Create a new secret key\" and copy the generated "
"key (you won’t be able to see it again)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:82
msgid ""
"You can use this API key to generate content using the AI Content Writer "
"plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:85
msgid ""
"Monitor Usage & Costs: Keep track of your API usage and costs in the OpenAI "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:86
msgid ""
"You can monitor your API usage and costs in the OpenAI dashboard. This will "
"help you manage your API usage and costs effectively."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:87
msgid "OpenAI API Pricing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:88
msgid "OpenAI API Usage"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:92
msgid "Here's how you can generate Pexels API key"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:93
msgid "Here are the steps to create a Pexels API key:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:96
msgid "Sign Up/Log In: Go to Pexels.com and create an account or log in."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:97
msgid "Pexels Website"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:100
msgid "Access API Page: Navigate to the Pexels API page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:101
msgid "Request API Page"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:104
msgid "Request API Key: Click \"Get Started\" or \"Request an API Key\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:105
msgid ""
"Fill out the form with your details and click on the \"Request API Key\" "
"button. You will receive an email with your API key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:108
msgid ""
"Get API Key: After approval, you'll receive your API key, visible on the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:109
msgid ""
"Copy the API key and save it in a secure location. You can use this API key "
"to generate thumbnail images for AI-generated content using the AI Content "
"Writer plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/views/help.php:110
msgid "Dashboard: Pexels API Key"
msgstr ""

